```{ojs}
plot1data = mydata7
  .filter(d =&gt; d[&#039;Organisation unit1&#039;] == &#039;Sindh&#039;)
  .groupby([&#039;Organisation unit2&#039;, &#039;Data&#039;])
  .rollup({
  mysum: op.sum(&#039;Value&#039;)
})
plot1data.view()
```
